    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……え？　あ、プロデューサー……さん……\r\nごめん……なさい、なにか言ってた……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、出番の確認に来たんだけど……\r\n緊張してるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花もひとりでの仕事に慣れてきたとは思うけど\r\n大きいステージに立つのはやっぱり緊張するよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それも、あるけど……\r\nなーちゃんも、ひとりで立ったあのステージに……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "今度は甜花が……ひとりで立っても、いいのかなって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに不安がることはないさ。甜花も、\r\nひとりでステージに立つにふさわしいアイドルになったんだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（それに、これだけ大きな舞台を経験できたら\r\nきっと甜花も大きな自信になるはずだ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……できるかな……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今の甜花なら、大丈夫だよ\r\n……さぁ、そろそろ出番だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\nい、行ってきます……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500104/1015001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001040090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、やっぱり……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
